"Reinforced concrete beam design<hr/><small>Simply supported beam of rectangular section to EN 1992-1-1 (recommended values)</small>
'<!--section:materials-->
'<b>Concrete</b>
'Strength class'f_ck = ? {30}
'Characteristic cylinder strength: 'f_ck'MPa
'Long-term coefficient: 'α_cc = ? {0.85}' (EN 1992-1-1 recommends 1.0; 0.85 is conservative)
'Partial factor: 'γ_c = 1.5
'Design compressive strength: 'f_cd = α_cc*f_ck/γ_c'MPa
'Mean axial tensile strength: 'f_ctm = 0.30*f_ck^(2/3)'MPa
'Secant modulus of elasticity: 'E_cm = 22*((f_ck + 8)/10)^0.3'GPa
'Final creep coefficient (Figure 3.1): 'φ = ? {2}
'Maximum aggregate size: 'd_g = ? {20}'mm
'<b>Reinforcement</b>
'Characteristic yield strength: 'f_yk = ? {500}'MPa
'Partial factor: 'γ_s = 1.15
'Design yield strength: 'f_yd = f_yk/γ_s'MPa
'Modulus of elasticity: 'E_s = 200'GPa
'<b>Durability</b>
'Exposure class'w_max = ? {0.3}
'Limiting crack width (Table 7.1N): 'w_max'mm
'<!--section:geometry-->
'Effective span: 'L = ? {6}'m
'Width: 'b = ? {300}'mm, overall depth: 'h = ? {500}'mm
'Nominal cover to the links: 'c_nom = ? {30}'mm
'<b>Reinforcement provided</b>
'Bottom bars: 'n_t = ? {3}' bars, diameter 'Φ_t = ? {20}'mm
'Top bars: 'n_c = ? {2}' bars, diameter 'Φ_c = ? {12}'mm
'Links: 'n_w = ? {2}' legs, diameter 'Φ_w = ? {8}'mm, spacing 's = ? {200}'mm
'<b>Section properties</b>
'Effective depth: 'd = h - c_nom - Φ_w - Φ_t/2'mm
'Depth to the top bars: 'd_2 = c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_c/2'mm
'Area of the bottom bars: 'A_s1 = n_t*π*Φ_t^2/4'mm²
'Area of the top bars: 'A_s2 = n_c*π*Φ_c^2/4'mm²
'<!--section:loads-->
'Superimposed permanent load: 'g_k,s = ? {10}'kN/m
'Variable load: 'q_k = ? {8}'kN/m
'Category of use'ψ_2 = ? {0.3}
'Quasi-permanent factor (EN 1990, Table A1.1): 'ψ_2
'Self-weight at 25 kN/m³: 'g_k,sw = 25*b*h*10^-6'kN/m
'Total permanent load: 'g_k = g_k,s + g_k,sw'kN/m
'<b>Combinations</b> (EN 1990)
'Partial factors: 'γ_G = 1.35', 'γ_Q = 1.5
'Ultimate limit state (6.10): 'w_Ed = γ_G*g_k + γ_Q*q_k'kN/m
'Quasi-permanent (6.16): 'w_qp = g_k + ψ_2*q_k'kN/m
'<!--section:calculations-->
'<h4>Analysis</h4>
'The beam is simply supported and uniformly loaded.
'Design bending moment at mid-span: 'M_Ed = w_Ed*L^2/8'kNm
'Design shear force at the supports: 'V_Ed = w_Ed*L/2'kN
'Quasi-permanent bending moment: 'M_qp = w_qp*L^2/8'kNm
#hide
PlotWidth = 400
PlotHeight = 110
#show
'Bending moment (kNm) and shear force (kN) along the span:
$Plot{w_Ed*x*(L - x)/2 @ x = 0 : L}
$Plot{w_Ed*(L/2 - x) @ x = 0 : L}
'<h4>Bending (6.1)</h4>
'Rectangular stress block (3.1.7): 'λ = 0.8', 'η = 1', ultimate strain: 'ε_cu3 = 0.0035
'Limit of the compression zone for ductility, without redistribution (5.5): 'ξ_lim = 0.45
'Relative design moment: 'm_Ed = M_Ed*10^6/(b*d^2*η*f_cd)
'Limit for a singly reinforced section: 'm_lim = λ*ξ_lim*(1 - λ*ξ_lim/2)', 'M_lim = m_lim*b*d^2*η*f_cd*10^-6'kNm
'Depth of the compression zone: 'x = d/λ*(1 - sqr(1 - 2*min(m_Ed; m_lim)))'mm
'Lever arm: 'z = min(d - λ*x/2; 0.95*d)'mm
#if M_Ed ≤ M_lim
	'Compression reinforcement is not required: 'M_Ed'kNm ≤ 'M_lim'kNm
	'Tension reinforcement required: 'A_s1,req = M_Ed*10^6/(f_yd*z)'mm²
	'Compression reinforcement required: 'A_s2,req = 0'mm²
	'Utilisation: 'η_M = A_s1,req/A_s1
#else
	'Compression reinforcement is required: 'M_Ed'kNm > 'M_lim'kNm
	'Strain in the top bars: 'ε_s2 = ε_cu3*(x - d_2)/x
	'Stress in the top bars: 'σ_s2 = min(E_s*10^3*ε_s2; f_yd)'MPa
	'Compression reinforcement required: 'A_s2,req = (M_Ed - M_lim)*10^6/(σ_s2*(d - d_2))'mm²
	'Tension reinforcement required: 'A_s1,req = (M_lim/z + (M_Ed - M_lim)/(d - d_2))*10^6/f_yd'mm²
	'Utilisation: 'η_M = max(A_s1,req/A_s1; A_s2,req/A_s2)
#end if
#if η_M ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the reinforcement provided exceeds the reinforcement required.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: provide more reinforcement, or make the section deeper.</p>
#end if
'<h4>Reinforcement limits (9.2.1.1) and bar spacing (8.2)</h4>
'Minimum tension reinforcement: 'A_s,min = max(0.26*f_ctm/f_yk; 0.0013)*b*d'mm²
'Maximum reinforcement: 'A_s,max = 0.04*b*h'mm²
'Utilisation: 'η_lim = max(A_s,min/A_s1; (A_s1 + A_s2)/A_s,max)
'Clear spacing of the bottom bars: 's_b = (b - 2*(c_nom + Φ_w) - n_t*Φ_t)/(n_t - 1)'mm
'Minimum clear spacing: 's_b,min = max(Φ_t; d_g + 5; 20)'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_sb = s_b,min/s_b
#if η_lim ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the area of reinforcement is within the limits.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: the area of reinforcement is outside the limits.</p>
#end if
#if η_sb ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the bottom bars are far enough apart.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: the bottom bars are too close: use fewer, larger bars, or two layers.</p>
#end if
'<h4>Shear (6.2)</h4>
'<b>Without shear reinforcement (6.2.2)</b>
'Size factor: 'k = min(1 + sqr(200/d); 2)
'Reinforcement ratio: 'ρ_l = min(A_s1/(b*d); 0.02)
'Minimum shear strength: 'v_min = 0.035*k^(3/2)*sqr(f_ck)'MPa
'Shear resistance: 'V_Rd,c = max(0.18/γ_c*k*(100*ρ_l*f_ck)^(1/3); v_min)*b*d*10^-3'kN
'<b>With vertical links (6.2.3)</b>
'Lever arm: 'z_v = 0.9*d'mm
'Strength reduction factor (6.6N): 'ν_1 = 0.6*(1 - f_ck/250)
'Strut capacity relative to the shear force: 'r_v = b*z_v*ν_1*f_cd/(V_Ed*10^3)
'Strut inclination, with 1 ≤ cot θ ≤ 2.5: 'cot_θ = max(1; min(2.5; (r_v + sqr(max(r_v^2 - 4; 0)))/2))', 'θ = atan(1/cot_θ)'°
'Maximum shear resistance (6.9): 'V_Rd,max = b*z_v*ν_1*f_cd/(cot_θ + 1/cot_θ)*10^-3'kN
'Links required (6.8): 'A_sw,req = if(V_Ed > V_Rd,c; V_Ed*10^3/(z_v*f_yd*cot_θ); 0)'mm²/mm
'Minimum links (9.4, 9.5N): 'A_sw,min = 0.08*sqr(f_ck)/f_yk*b'mm²/mm
'Links provided: 'A_sw = n_w*π*Φ_w^2/4/s'mm²/mm
'Maximum link spacing (9.6N): 's_max = min(0.75*d; 600)'mm
'Utilisation of the strut: 'η_V = V_Ed/V_Rd,max
'Utilisation of the links: 'η_w = max(A_sw,req; A_sw,min)/A_sw', spacing: 'η_s = s/s_max
#if η_V ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the concrete struts resist the shear force.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: the shear force crushes the struts: make the section wider or deeper, or use stronger concrete.</p>
#end if
#if max(η_w; η_s) ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the links provided are enough, and close enough together.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: provide more links, or put them closer together.</p>
#end if
'<h4>Crack control (7.3.4)</h4>
'Effective modulus of the concrete: 'E_c,eff = E_cm/(1 + φ)'GPa
'Modular ratio: 'α_e = E_s/E_c,eff
'Neutral axis depth of the cracked section: 'x_cr = (sqr((A_s1 + A_s2)^2 + 2*b*(d*A_s1 + d_2*A_s2)/α_e) - (A_s1 + A_s2))*α_e/b'mm
'Second moment of area of the cracked section: 'I_cr = b*x_cr^3/3 + α_e*(A_s1*(d - x_cr)^2 + A_s2*(x_cr - d_2)^2)'mm⁴
'Stress in the bottom bars, quasi-permanent: 'σ_s = α_e*M_qp*10^6*(d - x_cr)/I_cr'MPa
'Depth of the effective tension area: 'h_c,ef = min(2.5*(h - d); (h - x_cr)/3; h/2)'mm
'Effective reinforcement ratio: 'ρ_p,eff = A_s1/(b*h_c,ef)
'Cover to the bottom bars: 'c = c_nom + Φ_w'mm
'Maximum crack spacing (7.11, 7.14): 's_r,max = if(s_b + Φ_t ≤ 5*(c + Φ_t/2); 3.4*c + 0.8*0.5*0.425*Φ_t/ρ_p,eff; 1.3*(h - x_cr))'mm
'Mean strain difference (7.9), with <i>k</i><sub>t</sub> = 0.4: 'Δε = max(σ_s - 0.4*f_ctm/ρ_p,eff*(1 + E_s/E_cm*ρ_p,eff); 0.6*σ_s)/(E_s*10^3)
'Crack width (7.8): 'w_k = s_r,max*Δε'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_cr = w_k/w_max
#if η_cr ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the crack width is within the limit.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: the cracks are too wide: use more, smaller bars, or lower the steel stress.</p>
#end if
'<h4>Deflection: span to effective depth ratio (7.4.2)</h4>
'Reference reinforcement ratio: 'ρ_0 = sqr(f_ck)*10^-3
'Reinforcement ratios required at mid-span: 'ρ = A_s1,req/(b*d)', 'ρ_c = A_s2,req/(b*d)
'Structural system factor, simply supported (Table 7.4N): 'K_s = 1
'Basic limit (7.16): 'l_d,0 = K_s*if(ρ ≤ ρ_0; 11 + 1.5*sqr(f_ck)*ρ_0/ρ + 3.2*sqr(f_ck)*max(ρ_0/ρ - 1; 0)^1.5; 11 + 1.5*sqr(f_ck)*ρ_0/(ρ - ρ_c) + sqr(f_ck)*sqr(ρ_c/ρ_0)/12)
'Factor for the steel stress (7.17), at most 1.5: 'β_s = min(500/(f_yk*A_s1,req/A_s1); 1.5)
'Limiting ratio: 'l_d,lim = β_s*l_d,0
'Actual ratio: 'l_d = L*10^3/d
'Utilisation: 'η_δ = l_d/l_d,lim
#if η_δ ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>PASS</b>: the span to depth ratio is within the limit.</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>FAIL</b>: the beam may deflect too much: make it deeper, or calculate the deflection.</p>
#end if
'<!--section:results-->
#val
'<table class="bordered">
'<tr><th>Check</th><th>EN 1992-1-1</th><th>Utilisation</th><th>Result</th></tr>
'<tr><td>Bending reinforcement</td><td>6.1</td><td>'η_M'</td><td>
#if η_M ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Reinforcement limits</td><td>9.2.1.1</td><td>'η_lim'</td><td>
#if η_lim ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Bar spacing</td><td>8.2</td><td>'η_sb'</td><td>
#if η_sb ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Shear: struts</td><td>6.2.3</td><td>'η_V'</td><td>
#if η_V ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Shear: links</td><td>6.2.3, 9.2.2</td><td>'max(η_w; η_s)'</td><td>
#if max(η_w; η_s) ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Crack width</td><td>7.3.4</td><td>'η_cr'</td><td>
#if η_cr ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Deflection</td><td>7.4.2</td><td>'η_δ'</td><td>
#if η_δ ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'</table>
#equ
#if max(η_M; η_lim; η_sb; η_V; η_w; η_s; η_cr; η_δ) ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b>The beam passes every check.</b></p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b>The beam fails at least one check: see the table above.</b></p>
#end if
